 Many "Blue-Eyes" support cards like "<card mrk = '12294'/>" and "<card mrk = '16809'/>" have effects related to your Graveyard. Make sure to keep a close eye on the status of your Graveyard. Once preparations are set and you call upon powerful monsters like "<card mrk = '12487'/>," your complete and total victory is a stone's throw away!©ID1120025⁄VA "Swordsoul" Deck specializing in Synchro Summons and Tokens. 
 First, make use of effects like that of "<card mrk = '16489'/>" to Synchro Summon "<card mrk = '16527'/>" that has a high ATK and a powerful effect. You can also Synchro Summon "<card mrk = '16528'/>" with the likes of "<card mrk = '16491'/>" to build an unshakeable formation!©ID1130001ŸòA white dragon that will create new legends with "Blue-Eyes White Dragon."
